00:10.893 --> 00:12.686
We're done! We're done!

00:12.853 --> 00:14.772
I don't think I failed.

00:14.939 --> 00:16.482
Kitahara, Imamura...

00:16.649 --> 00:18.567
Do you want to go for a drink?

00:18.776 --> 00:19.777
Yeah. Nice.

00:19.944 --> 00:20.945
Sure, I'll go.

00:21.153 --> 00:23.239
All right! Let's go to your place, Kitahara.

00:23.405 --> 00:24.865
Yeah, at Kitahara's place.

00:25.032 --> 00:26.367
Got it. Kitahara's place.

00:26.533 --> 00:28.035
Okay. I'll take you guys there.

00:28.202 --> 00:30.037
Wait, there's something wrong here.

00:30.204 --> 00:31.497
What is it, Kitahara?

00:31.664 --> 00:33.749
Why does it have to be at my place?

00:33.916 --> 00:35.251
It's obvious.

00:35.417 --> 00:37.878
It's because there's something we want to check.

00:38.045 --> 00:39.713
-Check?
-Yeah.

00:39.880 --> 00:42.091
Imamura said so before, right?

00:42.466 --> 00:44.593
We're not dating or anything!

00:44.760 --> 00:46.845
But you live together.

00:47.054 --> 00:48.973
Hey, Kitahara.

00:49.139 --> 00:51.225
It's not true, right?

00:52.184 --> 00:56.522
You're not really living with Kotegawa, right?

00:56.689 --> 00:58.440
If they find out, they'll kill me!

00:58.607 --> 01:01.193
Wait, they already think I'm dating Chisa.

01:01.360 --> 01:03.153
The real problem is...

01:03.320 --> 01:08.158
If they found out I live with a beautiful,
hot girl like her...

01:08.325 --> 01:12.454
I can't imagine what they'd do to me.
I beg you, Kohei! Help me!

01:14.790 --> 01:16.917
You scumbag!

01:17.960 --> 01:21.797
Be passionate, my friends

01:21.964 --> 01:25.009
Shine bright with the sun

01:25.175 --> 01:28.512
Dive into the blue sky

01:28.679 --> 01:32.474
And let summer take it all

01:36.145 --> 01:39.481
