02:52.096 --> 02:53.764
Welcome back, Iori.

02:53.931 --> 02:54.973
Nanaka!

02:55.140 --> 02:56.183
What's wrong?

02:56.350 --> 02:58.894
The guys from college said they're coming over today.

02:59.061 --> 03:01.271
Wow, your friends are coming over.

03:01.438 --> 03:03.315
Please hide somewhere right now!

03:03.482 --> 03:04.858
What? Why?

03:05.025 --> 03:07.861
It's hard to explain.
To tell you the truth...

03:08.445 --> 03:10.739
my life is at stake.

03:10.906 --> 03:13.492
But I thought they were your friends.

03:15.202 --> 03:16.370
Hey.

03:16.537 --> 03:18.622
I brought some drinks and snacks.

03:18.831 --> 03:20.874
Oh, thanks.

03:21.083 --> 03:22.751
A diving shop?

03:22.918 --> 03:25.003
So this is where you're staying.

03:25.170 --> 03:26.630
It's a nice store.

03:26.797 --> 03:29.508
It's normally filled with dirty naked guys though.

03:29.716 --> 03:32.052
Well, my room is detached.

03:32.219 --> 03:33.887
Hey. Let's go.

03:34.054 --> 03:36.223
-What's the big idea?
-I want to look around.

03:36.390 --> 03:37.641
Don't worry.

03:38.350 --> 03:41.270
I can hide Chisa and Nanaka this way.

03:43.480 --> 03:45.899
Well, here is my room.

03:47.860 --> 03:49.403
Kitahara!

03:49.570 --> 03:51.655
Azusa!

03:51.864 --> 03:54.324
You bastard! I'm so jealous!

03:54.491 --> 03:55.909
I'll never forgive you!

03:56.118 --> 03:57.744
It's not what you think!

03:57.911 --> 04:00.038
Hey. Calm down, you guys.

04:00.247 --> 04:01.540
Yamamoto?

04:01.707 --> 04:03.542
Are you going to forgive this traitor?

04:03.709 --> 04:05.210
He didn't betray us.

04:05.377 --> 04:07.796
Don't get so worked up over a hat.

04:08.005 --> 04:09.965
-A hat?
-Are you going to put it on?

04:10.132 --> 04:13.177
He's so jealous he's lost touch with reality.

04:13.385 --> 04:15.179
What's this?

04:17.389 --> 04:18.849
Iori!

04:19.016 --> 04:20.809
Cakey!

04:21.018 --> 04:22.060
Is it a suppository?

04:22.227 --> 04:23.270
Does it look like one?

04:23.437 --> 04:24.480
Have you gone crazy?

04:24.646 --> 04:25.856
It's Kitahara's fault!

04:26.023 --> 04:27.316
What did I do wrong?

04:27.691 --> 04:31.570
This is-- Our club used it for a game.

04:32.488 --> 04:33.614
Really?

04:33.780 --> 04:36.158
It's not Kotegawa's size.

04:36.325 --> 04:39.953
-It's huge.
-Now that you mention it... Yeah. It's huge.

04:40.162 --> 04:42.789
There's no way it's real in the first place.

04:42.956 --> 04:46.251
If it is real, whoever took it off
couldn't have gone home.

04:46.418 --> 04:48.795
Girls don't go home without their bras, right?

04:48.962 --> 04:51.131
Well, she's not normal...

04:51.298 --> 04:53.842
Well, there's nothing else suspicious here.

04:56.053 --> 04:59.598
I must be mistaken...

05:04.144 --> 05:05.229
What's wrong, you guys?

05:05.395 --> 05:07.481
No! It's nothing.

05:07.689 --> 05:09.775
This guy has weird stuff.

05:09.942 --> 05:12.569
I get the feeling he's dangerous.

05:12.736 --> 05:15.614
Let's just pretend we didn't notice.

05:15.822 --> 05:17.241
FROM WORKS

05:17.824 --> 05:19.201
Are you trying to find a job?

05:19.368 --> 05:20.953
Trying to save up for something?

05:21.119 --> 05:23.997
Diving costs a lot of money.

05:24.206 --> 05:25.624
EVENT COMPANION

05:29.711 --> 05:31.547
Is he--?

05:31.713 --> 05:33.215
Let's just drink.

05:33.382 --> 05:36.510
Yeah. Let's drink and forget it.

05:36.677 --> 05:38.887
I'm too scared to think about it.

05:39.805 --> 05:41.431
What are you talking about?

05:41.598 --> 05:44.393
Congratulations for passing our make-up exam!

05:44.560 --> 05:46.019
Cheers!

05:50.566 --> 05:53.318
Beer gets bitter after a little while.

05:53.485 --> 05:54.528
I know!

05:54.695 --> 05:57.447
The first sip after diving tastes great.

05:57.614 --> 05:59.408
You're right.

05:59.992 --> 06:01.076
What's wrong, Yamamoto?

06:01.243 --> 06:03.745
You were in the bathroom for a long time.

06:03.912 --> 06:05.205
Hey, Kitahara.

06:05.372 --> 06:07.708
What?

06:11.128 --> 06:14.047
I met an angel...

06:15.382 --> 06:17.050
She's beautiful!

06:17.217 --> 06:18.260
Where did you see her?

06:18.427 --> 06:20.887
I went outside for some fresh air,
and there she was.

06:21.054 --> 06:22.097
Seriously?

06:22.264 --> 06:26.059
When I saw her just now, I thought...

06:27.769 --> 06:29.605
What did you think?

06:29.771 --> 06:32.190
I want to date her.

06:32.482 --> 06:34.276
-What?
-That's impossible.

06:34.443 --> 06:35.944
You're not a good match.

06:36.111 --> 06:39.740
I know that. But... But...

06:39.906 --> 06:42.701
If that's impossible, then I want her to have my children.

06:42.868 --> 06:44.536
This guy's an idiot.

06:44.703 --> 06:46.538
I'm embarrassed to admit I know him.

06:46.705 --> 06:49.124
-We're similar enough.
-You too...?

06:51.043 --> 06:52.085
Where are you going?

06:52.252 --> 06:53.295
Taking the last train?

06:53.462 --> 06:55.130
I'm going to look for that angel.

06:55.297 --> 06:56.340
What?

06:56.506 --> 06:57.841
What are you going to do?

06:58.342 --> 06:59.843
It's obvious, isn't it?

07:00.010 --> 07:02.095
I will kneel down and beg her to be with me!

07:02.262 --> 07:04.348
Is that how you tell a girl how you feel?

07:04.514 --> 07:07.267
Now I'm curious about your past.

07:07.434 --> 07:10.354
When I come back, I'll be a man!

07:11.063 --> 07:12.731
Oh, really...?

07:12.898 --> 07:14.399
A man, huh?

07:14.566 --> 07:16.109
Well, good luck.

07:16.860 --> 07:19.363
What do you think will happen?

07:19.529 --> 07:21.073
Well, she's beautiful, so...

07:21.239 --> 07:23.784
He'll get rejected on the spot and cry.

07:23.950 --> 07:25.202
I was thinking the same.

07:25.369 --> 07:27.871
We shouldn't make bets on this.

07:32.501 --> 07:35.170
Wait. What happened?

07:35.337 --> 07:36.672
Hey, Kitahara!

07:36.838 --> 07:38.298
What's going on?

07:38.465 --> 07:39.883
What's going on with you?

07:40.050 --> 07:41.885
Can't you tell by looking?

07:42.052 --> 07:44.304
-Can you tell?
-No idea.

07:44.471 --> 07:47.766
I was going over to the beach just now.

07:47.933 --> 07:51.561
But then I ran into a bunch of naked guys.

07:51.728 --> 07:53.188
Okay. I understand now.

07:53.355 --> 07:55.148
What do you mean you understand now?

07:55.774 --> 07:58.026
Not sure. But it must have been horrible!

07:58.193 --> 08:00.862
Seeing naked guys just makes my eyes rot.

08:01.029 --> 08:03.824
We see that every day.

08:03.990 --> 08:05.367
Have some more to drink.

08:05.534 --> 08:07.828
You were going to get rejected anyway.

08:07.994 --> 08:09.121
Drink up and forget it!

08:09.287 --> 08:11.415
You'll never get a girlfriend.

08:11.581 --> 08:14.459
Can't you guys comfort me a little?

08:14.626 --> 08:19.423
Anyway, we checked it out.
It appears Kitahara doesn't live with Kotegawa.

08:19.589 --> 08:20.590
Yeah.

08:20.757 --> 08:21.800
Yeah.

08:21.967 --> 08:23.427
You tell bad jokes, Imamura.

08:23.593 --> 08:25.303
No, I wasn't joking--

08:26.680 --> 08:29.182
Kohei likes telling jokes.

08:29.683 --> 08:32.352
I'm not even sure they're dating in the first place.

08:32.519 --> 08:33.770
I was thinking the same.

08:33.937 --> 08:36.481
It'd be weird if he had a girlfriend.

08:36.648 --> 08:38.734
You guys don't know anything about me.

08:38.900 --> 08:39.943
A cute girl wouldn't--

08:40.110 --> 08:42.738
Iori, I'm out of the shower.
You can take one--

08:46.158 --> 08:49.953
Sorry! I didn't know your friends were over.

09:03.133 --> 09:06.136
Kitahara!

09:06.303 --> 09:09.306
No! Listen to me--

09:09.473 --> 09:10.932
Kohei, help me!

09:11.099 --> 09:13.518
Don't get blood on the floor.

09:13.685 --> 09:16.313
You bastard!

09:20.650 --> 09:22.277
Hey, Chisa.

09:22.444 --> 09:23.487
What?

09:24.070 --> 09:28.283
Don't you feel sorry for me when you see me like this?

09:28.450 --> 09:29.493
Sorry.

09:29.659 --> 09:32.621
His life really was at stake...

09:36.374 --> 09:39.419
Wow, the ocean's so beautiful here! I want to go!

09:39.586 --> 09:40.754
Miyakojima, huh?

09:40.921 --> 09:42.714
I want to go there.

09:42.881 --> 09:46.051
I want to go diving there.

09:46.218 --> 09:48.470
Are you talking about diving?

09:48.637 --> 09:53.391
Tokita! I want to get my license soon
and go diving in lots of places!

09:54.226 --> 09:55.268
I see, I see.

09:55.435 --> 09:58.313
It's great that you're passionate about club activities.

09:58.480 --> 10:00.732
What are we doing today?

10:00.899 --> 10:03.527
I brought loose clothes, like you said.

10:04.027 --> 10:06.071
We're going to have a doubles tennis match.

10:06.238 --> 10:07.531
Hold on!

10:08.073 --> 10:09.825
It's training for the buddy system.

10:09.991 --> 10:11.284
That's not true, right?

10:12.035 --> 10:13.829
Actually, we're after the prize money.

10:13.995 --> 10:16.665
Tinkerbell's captain had an idea.

10:17.415 --> 10:21.837
If we lose, we'll give you the second-place prize money
from the women's and men's pageants.

10:22.045 --> 10:23.130
Tinkerbell? You mean--?

10:23.296 --> 10:26.132
We can't beat the tennis club at tennis!

10:26.299 --> 10:28.969
They're trying to get revenge.

10:29.135 --> 10:31.137
They're trying to humiliate us.

10:31.304 --> 10:33.014
-Yeah. I know.
-Then why?

10:33.181 --> 10:35.517
We concluded that...

10:35.684 --> 10:39.229
Your humiliation is a small price to pay
for the prize money.

10:39.396 --> 10:41.982
That's because you don't have anything on the line!

10:46.194 --> 10:47.988
Hit it!

10:48.154 --> 10:51.199
Those guys think they're watching a baseball game.

10:51.366 --> 10:53.994
They don't even know the rules.

10:54.494 --> 10:56.288
Aren't you guys going to join in?

10:56.454 --> 10:58.415
I'll cheer them on from here.

10:58.582 --> 11:01.167
I'll do my best to cheer them on too.

11:01.376 --> 11:03.461
You're wearing sweats.

11:03.628 --> 11:05.338
Why not wear tennis clothes?

11:05.505 --> 11:08.592
I'd feel embarrassed exposing my legs.

11:08.758 --> 11:10.844
But you wore them at the beauty pageant.

11:11.011 --> 11:12.554
I was wearing makeup.

11:12.721 --> 11:14.389
And I was drunk.

11:14.556 --> 11:16.725
What does "makeup" mean to you?

11:16.892 --> 11:17.976
And...

11:18.143 --> 11:22.606
I don't have the confidence to dress like that
next to those two.

11:23.023 --> 11:25.609
Well, sweats are what suit us.

11:25.775 --> 11:28.695
Yeah. We'd just stand out in tennis clothes.

11:28.862 --> 11:30.989
We're amateurs at tennis anyway.

11:31.156 --> 11:32.490
WOMEN'S LOCKER ROOM

11:32.657 --> 11:34.993
CHISA-CHAN PREPARED

11:35.160 --> 11:37.078
Today, as we agreed upon,

11:37.245 --> 11:40.332
we're going to have a doubles match with three sets.

11:40.498 --> 11:42.709
-Okay.
-I'm lost, but I'm fine with that.

11:43.084 --> 11:45.253
You're not dressed like a girl today.

11:45.420 --> 11:46.463
Neither are you.

11:46.630 --> 11:47.881
I never did!

11:48.840 --> 11:50.675
Is she new?

11:50.842 --> 11:51.968
Yes.

11:52.135 --> 11:54.429
He thinks they've never met before.

11:54.763 --> 11:58.600
Her makeup is like armor protecting her from enemies.

11:59.017 --> 12:00.769
Let the first game begin.

12:00.936 --> 12:03.855
Tokita! Kotobuki! You can do it!

12:04.022 --> 12:06.358
-Okay.
-I'm going to do my best!

12:06.524 --> 12:09.194
Okay. One, two...

12:11.571 --> 12:13.323
Fifteen-love!

12:15.617 --> 12:17.702
What was that just now?

12:17.869 --> 12:20.580
What's up with that serve?

12:20.747 --> 12:23.083
You won't get away that easily next time.

12:25.961 --> 12:28.046
-Nice, Kotobuki!
-Leave it to me!

12:28.213 --> 12:28.797
No!

12:29.422 --> 12:30.423
Take that!

12:31.800 --> 12:32.842
Thirty-love!

12:33.635 --> 12:34.719
Nice.

12:35.178 --> 12:38.890
Tokita! Kotobuki!

12:39.057 --> 12:40.725
They'll be fine.

12:40.892 --> 12:43.728
They're really good at sports.

12:45.480 --> 12:48.191
Where are the others?

12:48.358 --> 12:50.402
They were there just now.

12:50.568 --> 12:53.154
Maybe they drank too much.

12:53.321 --> 12:54.739
I'll go check on them.

12:54.906 --> 12:56.741
Thanks.

12:57.242 --> 12:59.119
What is this?

12:59.661 --> 13:01.955
They really are drunk.

13:02.122 --> 13:04.791
What's going on?

13:05.333 --> 13:08.294
Oh, Iori and Kohei!

13:08.461 --> 13:09.504
Hey!

13:09.671 --> 13:11.548
What's going on?

13:11.715 --> 13:14.968
Tinkerbell brought us some drinks...

13:15.135 --> 13:16.553
and we drank too much.

13:18.972 --> 13:20.849
There's still booze left?

13:21.016 --> 13:23.518
They hardly drank any of it.

13:25.562 --> 13:27.230
It evaporated in a flash!

13:27.397 --> 13:30.191
What did they make them drink?

13:30.358 --> 13:32.902
Let's cheer them on by ourselves.

13:34.237 --> 13:35.947
How is the match going?

13:36.114 --> 13:37.157
Well...

13:39.868 --> 13:41.995
He's not moving around so well anymore.

13:42.162 --> 13:44.914
Those two drank in secret.

13:46.875 --> 13:48.418
At this rate, we'll lose.

13:48.585 --> 13:51.337
I thought they'd be able to win.

13:51.504 --> 13:56.092
Kitahara, is there any way to sober them up?

13:56.634 --> 13:57.844
I've got an idea.

13:58.011 --> 13:59.304
Court change!

14:01.306 --> 14:02.390
This is easy.

14:02.557 --> 14:04.350
Yeah!

14:08.146 --> 14:09.189
What's this?

14:09.355 --> 14:11.191
There's something different inside.

14:14.444 --> 14:16.946
Won by Peek-a-Boo!

14:17.363 --> 14:18.406
What did you do?

14:18.573 --> 14:19.783
Our comeback strategy.

14:19.949 --> 14:23.078
Instead of getting our team sober,
we're going to get them drunk.

14:23.244 --> 14:24.746
What about sportsmanship?

14:26.414 --> 14:27.916
We won one match.

14:28.083 --> 14:29.793
It's your turn.

14:29.959 --> 14:32.087
-Off you go.
-Okay.

14:33.379 --> 14:36.382
By the way, where are my sweats?

14:36.549 --> 14:38.843
They're at home.

14:39.886 --> 14:42.430
I don't feel good about this.

14:42.597 --> 14:44.557
Kotegawa, are you good at tennis?

14:44.724 --> 14:45.725
Kind of.

14:45.892 --> 14:46.976
Hello there

14:47.185 --> 14:49.187
You're from the beauty pageant.

14:49.354 --> 14:50.772
I got second place.

14:50.939 --> 14:54.275
You're Kotegawa!
You won by having your skirt flipped up!

14:54.901 --> 14:58.363
Too bad. Being sexy won't work on us.

14:58.530 --> 15:02.867
Stick to flipping your skirt for the audience.

15:04.661 --> 15:07.038
Kotegawa?

15:07.205 --> 15:08.998
Game play!

15:13.586 --> 15:17.090
This is a real match, unlike just a little while ago.

15:17.257 --> 15:19.926
-How rude!
-We played hard too.

15:20.093 --> 15:21.761
Yeah, yeah. Drink some water.

15:21.928 --> 15:23.513
Do your best, you two!

15:24.973 --> 15:27.142
Chisa's really into it.

15:27.517 --> 15:28.643
You!

15:33.982 --> 15:35.483
Nice cover!

15:35.650 --> 15:37.694
You two are good friends.

15:39.320 --> 15:42.615
Let's do a cheer!
Repeat after me.

15:42.782 --> 15:43.950
Chisa, nice buddy!

15:44.117 --> 15:45.368
Nice buddy, Kotegawa!

15:45.535 --> 15:47.120
Nice buddy, Chii-chan!

15:47.287 --> 15:49.372
Chisa-chan, really nice buddy!

15:49.539 --> 15:51.457
I heard there's a girl with a nice body!

15:51.624 --> 15:53.251
Really? Where?

15:53.418 --> 15:56.337
Chisa! Chisa! Chisa! Nice buddy!

15:56.504 --> 15:58.840
Stop!

15:59.007 --> 16:02.010
Change of plan.
Let's destroy the slow one first.

16:02.177 --> 16:03.261
Okay.

16:03.428 --> 16:05.722
Game count, two-love!

16:10.518 --> 16:11.644
Are you okay?

16:11.811 --> 16:13.813
Hey! That was dangerous!

16:13.980 --> 16:15.982
They're aiming for the body.

16:16.399 --> 16:17.442
Aiming for the body?

16:17.609 --> 16:20.528
It's when you aim for
the opponent's body.

16:20.695 --> 16:21.738
I see.

16:24.824 --> 16:27.035
Kotegawa paid them back.

16:27.202 --> 16:28.912
She was aiming for their bodies too.

16:29.078 --> 16:30.914
Good aim!

16:31.080 --> 16:33.166
I see. Well, then...

16:33.333 --> 16:34.375
Chisa! Nice body!

16:34.542 --> 16:35.627
Nice body, Kotegawa!

16:35.793 --> 16:38.379
Chisa-chan, excellent nice body!

16:38.546 --> 16:40.048
Which girl is it? Where is she?

16:40.215 --> 16:42.258
Just stop!

16:44.219 --> 16:47.138
Won by Tinkerbell!

16:48.181 --> 16:49.641
What happened, Chisa?

16:49.807 --> 16:52.268
You kept holding your skirt down.

16:53.061 --> 16:57.106
I want to start the third match.

16:57.273 --> 16:59.067
Are you okay?

16:59.234 --> 17:01.069
Where are your sweats?

17:01.236 --> 17:02.320
Don't worry about it.

17:02.487 --> 17:05.782
Being naked is his uniform.

17:09.577 --> 17:11.788
I was wondering how this would turn out.

17:12.121 --> 17:14.916
I'm going humiliate this guy.

17:20.129 --> 17:22.048
Fifteen-love!

17:22.382 --> 17:24.050
Here I go.

17:29.889 --> 17:31.557
Thirty-love!

17:31.724 --> 17:34.227
I didn't know Iori was good at sports.

17:34.394 --> 17:37.397
He had good control back there too.

17:37.564 --> 17:40.066
Yeah. When he flipped up Chisa's skirt.

17:41.734 --> 17:42.777
You...

17:42.944 --> 17:44.779
Leave it to me. Except for swimming!

17:45.697 --> 17:47.198
Don't be so full of yourself.

17:47.365 --> 17:48.574
Here we go!

17:48.741 --> 17:50.535
-Take that!
-You--

17:51.744 --> 17:53.871
-Kohei!
-Okay!

17:54.038 --> 17:56.291
Take that!

18:05.508 --> 18:08.261
Kitahara... They're pretty good.

18:08.428 --> 18:10.680
You're just too bad.

18:24.569 --> 18:27.113
Game count, four-love!

18:27.280 --> 18:28.865
This is bad!

18:29.032 --> 18:31.617
This isn't working.

18:31.784 --> 18:33.995
You're the one that's not working.

18:34.162 --> 18:35.872
Oh, yeah.

18:36.039 --> 18:37.373
I forgot to mention...

18:37.540 --> 18:43.254
Our club records matches
so we can study them later.

18:43.421 --> 18:45.006
What?

18:45.173 --> 18:46.341
Hey, you bastards!

18:46.507 --> 18:48.676
You just want to laugh at us when we lose!

18:48.843 --> 18:50.845
It's not about you losing...

18:51.012 --> 18:53.473
We're already laughing about the way you're dressed.

18:54.265 --> 18:56.768
Kohei, it looks like it has come down to this.

18:56.934 --> 18:58.353
I know.

18:58.519 --> 19:01.272
We have no choice.

19:01.439 --> 19:02.857
A KO!

19:03.983 --> 19:06.611
Are you guys plotting something?

19:07.820 --> 19:09.614
Of course not.

19:10.740 --> 19:12.492
Die!

19:14.994 --> 19:16.788
What was that shout?

19:16.954 --> 19:19.290
Nice, Kitahara! Nice serve!

19:19.457 --> 19:21.542
All that's left is the fine adjustment.

19:21.709 --> 19:23.169
That's not a nice serve!

19:23.336 --> 19:26.631
It didn't bounce, and it hit the fence!

19:27.340 --> 19:28.383
Look out!

19:28.549 --> 19:29.592
Don't dodge, coward!

19:29.759 --> 19:30.885
Who's the coward?

19:33.471 --> 19:37.350
Be careful.
If I dodge it, then I'm the one who gets the point.

19:37.517 --> 19:39.894
Yeah. I know.

19:43.106 --> 19:44.690
No way!

19:49.737 --> 19:52.115
They're not letting their guard down.

19:52.281 --> 19:53.783
Captain!

19:53.950 --> 19:56.077
You've had enough, right? Just surrender.

19:56.244 --> 19:58.079
You loser!

19:58.246 --> 20:00.415
I'm going to hit him or the camera!

20:00.581 --> 20:03.334
Did we really have to play against them?

20:03.501 --> 20:04.585
This is all your fault!

20:04.752 --> 20:08.339
I don't care what happens now.
Just use one of your dirty tricks.

20:08.506 --> 20:12.051
Look who's talking!

20:12.844 --> 20:14.178
So you don't care what I do?

20:14.345 --> 20:15.430
Of course.

20:17.348 --> 20:18.724
I see.

20:18.891 --> 20:21.811
Then I'm going to aim for a KO!

20:21.978 --> 20:23.438
All right, that's my Kitahara!

20:36.951 --> 20:37.994
Bull's-eye!

20:39.203 --> 20:41.414
What are you trying to...?

20:41.581 --> 20:44.167
We had an accident. Our player is out.

20:44.333 --> 20:47.170
We can switch players, right?

20:47.336 --> 20:48.754
Is this where I come in?

20:48.921 --> 20:50.381
I can play too!

20:56.053 --> 20:57.513
4-6
VICTORY!

20:59.765 --> 21:01.601
Look what you did, you bastard!

21:01.767 --> 21:04.312
You said you didn't care what I did!

21:04.479 --> 21:05.605
To them, you idiot!

21:05.771 --> 21:08.232
There's not an ounce of sportsmanship.

21:08.399 --> 21:10.902
Well, they won!

21:11.068 --> 21:13.696
Iori is really good at tennis.

21:13.863 --> 21:15.740
Did you play in high school?

21:15.907 --> 21:17.909
After the entrance exams were over.

21:18.075 --> 21:19.118
You weren't in a club?

21:19.285 --> 21:20.328
No...

21:20.703 --> 21:23.831
I heard tennis was the best way
to get a girlfriend in college.

21:23.998 --> 21:25.374
So I trained with my friends.

21:25.541 --> 21:26.542
That's so shallow.

21:26.709 --> 21:28.377
You're so simple.

21:28.544 --> 21:33.508
Are you okay with not joining the tennis club?
You trained so hard.

21:33.674 --> 21:34.800
It's okay.

21:34.967 --> 21:37.011
I didn't even have a chance to choose.

21:37.178 --> 21:38.721
That's too bad.

21:38.888 --> 21:40.681
You have a tough life, Iori.

21:40.848 --> 21:43.518
What happened to your memory?

21:43.684 --> 21:46.145
Anyway, I'm done with tennis.

21:46.312 --> 21:47.396
Are you sure?

21:47.563 --> 21:50.608
There's something else I want to do now.

21:51.609 --> 21:53.611
I see, I see.

21:56.656 --> 21:58.282
Thanks.

21:58.449 --> 21:59.951
Yeah.

22:00.701 --> 22:03.538
And with that, we got the prize money.

22:03.704 --> 22:05.289
Let's have an overnight trip!

22:05.456 --> 22:07.166
Our destination will be Okinawa!

22:07.333 --> 22:08.417
-Okinawa?
-Okinawa?

22:08.584 --> 22:10.920
-Seriously?
-Seriously?

22:11.087 --> 22:12.880
That's...

22:13.339 --> 22:16.425
That's the magazine about Okinawa
we were looking at.

22:16.801 --> 22:20.179
Did they do this for us?

22:20.346 --> 22:22.265
Okinawa. That's amazing.

22:22.431 --> 22:23.891
Yeah.

22:25.434 --> 22:31.315
HOW TO DRINK OKINAWAN LIQUOR

22:32.316 --> 22:33.401
DEEP BLUE AL FINE
KAYA MIZUKI

22:33.568 --> 22:35.653
Here's your mic, Kitahara.

22:35.820 --> 22:39.824
Me, too...? All right, let's do this!

22:39.991 --> 22:43.369
-Yeah, sing your heart out.
-You guys seem to be having fun.

22:44.996 --> 22:51.002
A fairytale whispers
In a fake world

22:51.168 --> 22:56.924
Hiding in the complete darkness

22:57.091 --> 23:02.888
I reach for the forbidden fruit
In my last days

23:03.055 --> 23:09.186
Now I know the meaning of the song about hope

23:09.353 --> 23:14.442
A broken gear will never stop again

23:14.609 --> 23:22.033
Even if I were to lose everything
I'd still want you to know

23:22.199 --> 23:28.122
Trapped in the sky so far away
I'm praying with ripped off wings

23:28.331 --> 23:34.086
Because we span together
The vows of areppegio

23:34.253 --> 23:40.009
If life sparkles only to the beat
of the resonating stars

23:40.176 --> 23:43.012
I'll sacrifice everything

23:43.179 --> 23:47.558
Till death do us apart

23:47.767 --> 23:49.769
Cheers!

23:54.440 --> 23:57.068
We now take a commercial break!

24:02.615 --> 24:05.076
-So you were a bartender?
-Cool!

24:05.326 --> 24:07.119
Why don't you try it too?

24:07.328 --> 24:08.829
It looks good on you two!

24:10.331 --> 24:12.500
My eyes! My eyes!

24:12.708 --> 24:14.377
We have a naked relationship.

24:14.543 --> 24:16.879
NEXT EPISODE
"A MAN'S COCKTAIL"
